{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/A_Dystopian_Alternate_World.png?t=1742183388\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the darkness of an alternate world where Germany won the Second World War.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this world, secret and cruel experiments are conducted on humans to satisfy a thirst for control and power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are one of these guinea pigs, held captive in a research and experimentation center, subjected to the terrifying nightmares orchestrated by the sinister Dr. Schmidt and his team of unscrupulous doctors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif6.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1742183388\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run \u2192</strong> The main monster is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill \u2192</strong> The corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search \u2192</strong> Destroy crates, open drawers, and explore every corner to find runes, ammo, and healing items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft \u2192</strong> Combine your findings to create even rarer runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell \u2192</strong> Sell your runes to merchants in exchange for Tears of Resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade \u2192</strong> Runes enhance your skills, unlock new crafting options, and grant access to cosmetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif4.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light will be your ally to regenerate your mental health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into terrifying nightmares and use your passive and active skills to face them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif3.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Passive powers give you permanent advantages, while active powers allow you to trigger powerful effects to get you out of difficult situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the frequency machine to alter the course of the game, intensify the difficulty, and accumulate more XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To continue your journey through the nightmare, you must complete tasks to activate the portals by restoring the faces of the guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif2.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/PlayerProgression.png?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif1.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each game, you return to the lobby where you can spend your Tears of Resilience to purchase cosmetics, upgrade your plans, and improve your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Achievements.png?t=1742183388\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Would you dare to complete the 15 Steam achievements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/wishlistgif.gif?t=1742183388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/join_our_discord_end_page.png?t=1742183388\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2215790?t=1742183388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/69d8f4880f46748bd8705bfaa127bccc435b29ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742183388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/4eb41e056bf78018c124eaf9fd34eeb9fba53645/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742183388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/4eb41e056bf78018c124eaf9fd34eeb9fba53645/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742183388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may include content that is not suitable for all ages or f